Real-Time Example: Bus Ticket Booking
Main Conversation

User:

Book a bus from Chennai to Madurai tomorrow.

Nested Chat
User
   │
   ▼
Assistant Agent
   │
   ├── Starts Nested Chat
   │
   ▼
Search Agent ───► Finds buses
      │
      ▼
Seat Agent ───► Checks seat availability
      │
      ▼
Fare Agent ───► Calculates ticket price
      │
      ▼
Returns result
   │
   ▼
Assistant Agent
   │
   ▼
Replies to User

The user only sees the final answer, while the agents communicate internally to complete the booking.

