Example: Nested Chat in AutoGen
from autogen import AssistantAgent, UserProxyAgent

# Configure LLM
llm_config = {
    "config_list": [
        {
            "model": "gpt-4",
            "api_key": "YOUR_API_KEY"
        }
    ]
}

# Main Assistant
assistant = AssistantAgent(
    name="Assistant",
    llm_config=llm_config,
)

# Search Agent
search_agent = AssistantAgent(
    name="SearchAgent",
    llm_config=llm_config,
    system_message="You search available buses."
)

# Fare Agent
fare_agent = AssistantAgent(
    name="FareAgent",
    llm_config=llm_config,
    system_message="You calculate ticket fares."
)

# User Proxy
user = UserProxyAgent(
    name="User",
    code_execution_config=False
)

# Register Nested Chat
assistant.register_nested_chats(
    [
        {
            "recipient": search_agent,
            "message": "Find buses from Chennai to Madurai tomorrow."
        },
        {
            "recipient": fare_agent,
            "message": "Calculate the fare for the available buses."
        }
    ],
    trigger=user
)

# Start Main Chat
user.initiate_chat(
    assistant,
    message="Book a bus ticket from Chennai to Madurai tomorrow."
)

===

How it Works

User
  │
  ▼
Assistant Agent
  │
  ├──► Nested Chat 1
  │      Search Agent
  │      Finds available buses
  │
  ├──► Nested Chat 2
  │      Fare Agent
  │      Calculates ticket fare
  │
  ▼
Assistant combines both results
  │
  ▼
Final reply to User

