| Travel Planner      | Travel Agent    | Flight Agent, Hotel Agent, Weather Agent                  |


======

Key Idea

In a Nested Chat, the main agent temporarily starts one or more internal conversations with specialized agents to complete subtasks.
After receiving their responses, it combines the results and sends a single, final response back to the user. 
This lets complex tasks be broken into smaller, coordinated steps while keeping the user's interaction simple.

